rm Target: windows | Architecture: x86 | Is Malware: Unknown\nPre-computed Token Length: 580374 segments\nStructural Footprint Sample: [53341, 271, 259, 525, 52384, 52357, 51941, 22837, 2586, 7156, 5481, 104, 258, 224, 579",
